# The server image only needs the workspace manifests, shared/, packages/, server/ and the backup
# script. Never .backups (the owner's book text; the image is public) or server/.env.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!frontend/package.json
!shared/
!packages/
!server/
!infra/backup.sh
**/node_modules
server/.env
server/.env.*
